From 95bce58c2d68833a62ec963ab7c3c2d1853e56cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Care Africa <dev@careafrica.local>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:22:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Rand everywhere, consistent brand colours, redesigned
 sign-in and dashboard

- One rand formatter (R 1 234,50) for every amount; rand icon replaces dollar icons
- Register/verify pages no longer blue; sign-in, register, verify share a split-screen layout in Care Africa colours
- All remaining hardcoded blues follow the practice brand colour; antd tables and charts too
- New type (Plus Jakarta Sans, bundled), neutrals, cards, buttons, inputs
- Sidebar grouped by area with practice identity and account; dashboard rebuilt around today's queue
- SA date formats; booking-request buttons no longer cut off; status badge handles requests

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EwPyWPTXSAWwnbXCzMZAVM
